{"words": [{"text": "۞ لَّيْسَ", "translation": "Not"}, {"text": "عَلَيْكَ", "translation": "on you"}, {"text": "هُدَىٰهُمْ", "translation": "(is) their guidance"}, {"text": "وَلَـٰكِنَّ", "translation": "[and] but"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "يَهْدِى", "translation": "guides"}, {"text": "مَن", "translation": "whom"}, {"text": "يَشَآءُ ۗ", "translation": "He wills"}, {"text": "وَمَا", "translation": "And whatever"}, {"text": "تُنفِقُوا۟", "translation": "you spend"}, {"text": "مِنْ", "translation": "of"}, {"text": "خَيْرٍۢ", "translation": "good"}, {"text": "فَلِأَنفُسِكُمْ ۚ", "translation": "then it is for yourself"}, {"text": "وَمَا", "translation": "and not"}, {"text": "تُنفِقُونَ", "translation": "you spend"}, {"text": "إِلَّا", "translation": "except"}, {"text": "ٱبْتِغَآءَ", "translation": "seeking"}, {"text": "وَجْهِ", "translation": "(the) face"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ ۚ", "translation": "(of) Allah"}, {"text": "وَمَا", "translation": "And whatever"}, {"text": "تُنفِقُوا۟", "translation": "you spend"}, {"text": "مِنْ", "translation": "of"}, {"text": "خَيْرٍۢ", "translation": "good"}, {"text": "يُوَفَّ", "translation": "will be repaid in full"}, {"text": "إِلَيْكُمْ", "translation": "to you"}, {"text": "وَأَنتُمْ", "translation": "and you"}, {"text": "لَا", "translation": "(will) not"}, {"text": "تُظْلَمُونَ", "translation": "be wronged"}], "sahih": "Not upon you, [O Muḥammad], is [responsibility for] their guidance, but Allāh guides whom He wills. And whatever good you [believers] spend is for yourselves, and you do not spend except seeking the face [i.e., approval] of Allāh. And whatever you spend of good1 - it will be fully repaid to you, and you will not be wronged."}